                "tail": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "tag": "title",
                "attributes": {},
                "text": "Aurissa",
                "tail": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "tag": "rubric",
                "attributes": {},
                "text": "Incipit Aurissa fratris Iacobi de Sareponth, quam qui intelligit, potest loqui de theologia, quidquid vult",
                "tail": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "tag": "incipit",
                "attributes": {},
                "text": "Theologia est sciencia pro naturato a naturante",
                "tail": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "tag": "explicit",
                "attributes": {},
                "text": "ut me miserum peccatorem facias oracionum tuarum participem. Amen.",
                "tail": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "tag": "finalRubric",
                "attributes": {},
                "text": "Explicit Aurissa, michi lector sis precorissa / Qui facit non fit, facit et fit, non facit et fit / Non relegas versus, cui presit nescio sensus. - Perdicitur, persubditur, peradditur, peradiungitur.",
                "tail": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "tag": "note",
                "attributes": {},
                "text": "Týž text se nachází v rukopisu Knihovny pražské metropolitní kapituly D LXI /Podlaha 627/, fol. 1r–15r.",
                "tail": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "tag": "textLang",
                "attributes": {
                  "mainLang": "la"
                },
                "text": "latinsky",
                "tail": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t",
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "msItem",
            "attributes": {
              "n": "3"
            },
            "text": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
            "tail": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t",
            "children": [
              {
                "tag": "locus",
                "attributes": {
                  "from": "14r",
                  "to": "14v"
                },
                "text": "14r–14v",
                "tail": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "tag": "title",
                "attributes": {},
                "text": "De modo sermocinandi latine et bohemice",
                "tail": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "tag": "incipit",
                "attributes": {},
                "text": "Extrahe notabilitates in latino a clausulis, similiter et in Bohemico",
                "tail": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "tag": "explicit",
                "attributes": {},
                "text": "poteris ordinare secundum voluntatem tuam etc. Amen.",
                "tail": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "tag": "note",
                "attributes": {},
                "text": "Všude, kde původní písař uvedl \n",
                "tail": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "tag": "q",
                    "attributes": {},
                    "text": "in Bohemico",
                    "tail": ", opravila pozdější ruka text na \n",
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "tag": "q",
                    "attributes": {},
                    "text": "in Theutonico",
                    "tail": ". Srov. rkp uvedený v předchozí poznámce.",
                    "children": []
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "tag": "textLang",
